# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Vulnerability & Misconfiguration Ignore Policy (.trivyignore)
# Target Architecture: Enterprise AWS Three-Tier Workload (ap-south-1)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) Policy Exceptions
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0053
# Target: terraform/modules/alb/main.tf
# Title: Load balancer listener configured with HTTP protocol
# Architectural Rationale: Port 80 HTTP listener is explicitly configured with a
# 301 permanent redirect rule forwarding all traffic to Port 443 HTTPS. No cleartext
# application data is served over port 80.
# Expiration: 2027-12-31
AVD-AWS-0053

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0004
# Target: terraform/bootstrap/main.tf
# Title: S3 bucket without MFA delete enabled
# Architectural Rationale: Bootstrap remote state bucket uses native S3 locking
# (use_lockfile = true) and versioning. MFA delete requires root credentials not
# available during automated pipeline provisioning.
# Expiration: 2027-12-31
AVD-AWS-0004

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Container Image Exceptions
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All CRITICAL unfixed CVEs are blocked by --ignore-unfixed --severity CRITICAL.
# No active container CVE exemptions granted.
